Toi da co counter-evidence manh cho finding 2: WordPress core AJAX wrappers tu them `install_plugins` / `activate_plugin` checks, trong khi Kubio goi thang sink. Phan con mo la nonce co thuc su den duoc tay role thap hon `edit_theme_options` hay khong, nen toi dang trac them duong enqueue script de xem claim “obtain the demo-site nonce” co bi phong dai hay khong.
