codex
Wrote the Phase 3b skeptic review to [kubio-phase3-review.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase3/kubio-phase3-review.codex.json) and [2-kubio.codex.llm.md](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase3/2-kubio.codex.llm.md). Both reviewable findings stayed `UNCERTAIN -> keep`, with corrected sink lines, explicit missing-evidence notes, and concrete dynamic test plans.

Validation: the JSON parses cleanly with `jq`. I did not run live WordPress or multisite exploitation; the report stays at skeptic-review scope and pushes the remaining proof burden into the test plans.

Official WordPress references used to sanity-check sink behavior: [Plugin_Upgrader::install()](https://developer.wordpress.org/reference/classes/plugin_upgrader/install/), [activate_plugin()](https://developer.wordpress.org/reference/functions/activate_plugin/), [wp_ajax_install_plugin()](https://developer.wordpress.org/reference/functions/wp_ajax_install_plugin/), [wp_ajax_activate_plugin()](https://developer.wordpress.org/reference/functions/wp_ajax_activate_plugin/).
